<div class="page-header">
  <h2>Institutions</h2>
  <a href="/institutions/new" class="btn btn-primary">+ Add</a>
</div>
<p class="page-desc">Agencies, foundations, universities, and organizations you pursue opportunities with — the anchor entities in your BD network.</p>

<details class="how-to">
  <summary>How to use Institutions</summary>
  <div class="how-to-body">
    <ol>
      <li>Institutions are the <strong>organizations you do business with</strong> — federal agencies, state agencies, foundations, universities, prime contractors, and nonprofits.</li>
      <li>Add an institution before adding contacts or opportunities linked to it — the system uses institutions as the anchor for your entire network.</li>
      <li>Include the website, type, and region so you can filter intelligently when building teaming arrangements or targeting a specific sector.</li>
      <li>Click an institution's name to see all linked contacts and opportunities in one view.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>Examples to add: Department of Defense, NEA, California Arts Council, local prime contractors you could team with, or foundations that fund preservation work.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<form class="filter-bar" method="GET" action="/institutions">
  <input type="text" name="q" value="<%= filters.q || '' %>" placeholder="Search name…" class="filter-input">
  <input type="text" name="state" value="<%= filters.state || '' %>" placeholder="State (e.g. CA)" class="filter-input filter-input--sm">
  <button type="submit" class="btn btn-secondary">Filter</button>
  <a href="/institutions" class="btn-link">Clear</a>
</form>

<% if (institutions.length === 0) { %>
  <p class="empty-state">No institutions found.</p>
<% } else { %>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="data-table">
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>City</th><th>State</th><th>Region</th><th>Website</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <% institutions.forEach(function(i) { %>
          <tr>
            <td><a href="/institutions/<%= i.id %>"><%= i.name %></a></td>
            <td><%= i.institution_type || '—' %></td>
            <td><%= i.city || '—' %></td>
            <td><%= i.state || '—' %></td>
            <td><%= i.region || '—' %></td>
            <td><% if (i.website) { %><a href="<%= i.website %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&#8599;</a><% } else { %>—<% } %></td>
          </tr>
        <% }); %>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
<% } %>
